{"id":356,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"There are rumors that peeking inside its bandage-wrapped body will cause one to get pulled in through the gaps between the bandages, never to return. I've been too scared to verify."},{"games":["Shield","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery."},{"games":["Sword","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Dusclops absorbs anything, however large the object may be. This Pokémon hypnotizes its foe by waving its hands in a macabre manner and by bringing its single eye to bear. The hypnotized foe is made to do Dusclops’s bidding."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Dusclops’s body is completely hollow—there is nothing at all inside. It is said that its body is like a black hole. This Pokémon will absorb anything into its body, but nothing will ever come back out."},{"games":["Y","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its body is hollow. It is said that those who look into its body are sucked into the void."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Anyone who dares peer into its body to see its spectral ball of fire will have their spirit stolen away."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It is thought that its body is hollow with only a spectral ball of fire burning inside. However, no one has been able to confirm this theory as fact."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Pressure","hidden":false,"description":"Puts other Pokémon under pressure, causing them to expend more PP to use their moves."},{"name":"Frisk","hidden":true,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon can check an opposing Pokémon's held item."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"forest","color":"Black","shape":"Humanoid","e